   found by reading the shipped `indented-fields` read row before the rerun.
2. The measurement's own comparison of the stage maps: vf_config refuses 001's and 002's tasks.md on both kits
   alike (`unknown checkpoint stage Backend` / `API`, the kit's stack.yml naming stages those specs lack) and writes
   no catalog, and the check ran `diff -r` on two missing directories (4 FAIL). Corrected to compare the
